    "carplay|certification-1st|location-test-wireless-performance": {
      "text": "<ul><li>Vehicle Allocation:​​ CTC</li><ul><li>CarPlay: Internal Amplifier.​​</li><li>Android Auto: External Amplifier.​​</li></ul><li>Prerequisites: GPS Location and Dead Reckoning validation.​​</li><li>Risks: Lab availability, Christmas/New Year holidays, and potential vehicle scheduling conflicts.​​</li><li>Action: MD to validate GPS Location and Harman's Dead Reckoning algorithm ASAP to enable early lab booking and potentially advance Location Testing.​​</li><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 59, 59)\">​​Business trip: Dec 4 Taipei team to CTC for testing</span></li></ul></ul>",
