      "text": "<p><strong>1. CarPlay (CP)</strong></p><ul><li><div><div><p><strong>Total open issues: 30</strong></p></div></div></li><li><div><div><p><strong>TS-owned issues: 6</strong></p><ul><li><div><div><p>2 issues are being addressed without blockers and are expected to be resolved by Dec. 7.</p></div></div></li><li><div><div><p>4 issues are related to SCD. The technical solution needs to be finalized this week, while the joint debugging schedule is pending Subbu's confirmation.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></li><li><div><div><p><strong>Non-TS-owned issues: 24</strong></p><ul><li><div><div><p>KVVD Subrahmanyam: 6 issues</p></div></div></li><li><div><div><p>Weili Chou: 3 issues</p></div></div></li><li><div><div><p>Other assignees: fewer than 2 issues each.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></li></ul><div><br></div>",
